{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-34","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-rogue-34"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-34-talk-403813601-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-34","missionId":"event-rogue-34","mission":"술집","scene":"술집","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"에일비르 스타일의 작은 술집에 왔다. 아주 즐거운 분위기가 느껴진다","talkId":403813601,"textHash":"13527638361829759915","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:34/talk-403813601","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"e9c6d97ed6e59a81","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-34-talk-403813602-line"],"bwikiPage":"酒馆","bwikiRevision":58639,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9298","bwikiMission":"술집"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-34-talk-403813602-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-34","missionId":"event-rogue-34","mission":"술집","scene":"술집","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"마리에르 오렌지와 종려 시나몬으로 만든 술 한 잔을 시킨다. 가면을 쓴 채 각기 다른 체격을 하고 있는 사람들을 살펴본 당신은 이곳이 「가면의 우인」들이 모이는 술집임을 발견한다","talkId":403813602,"textHash":"2249777523513768869","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:34/talk-403813602","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"e9c6d97ed6e59a81","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-34-talk-403813603-line"],"bwikiPage":"酒馆","bwikiRevision":58639,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9298","bwikiMission":"술집"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-34-talk-403813603-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-34","missionId":"event-rogue-34","mission":"술집","scene":"술집","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「『세상 끝』 술집에 오신 것을 환영합니다」 바텐더 블라치가 손님들에게 깊이 허리 숙이며 말한다. 「이곳은 유머 감각이 있는 손님만 들어오실 수 있습니다」","talkId":403813603,"textHash":"3832044235433544044","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:34/talk-403813603","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"e9c6d97ed6e59a81","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-34-talk-403813604-line"],"bwikiPage":"酒馆","bwikiRevision":58639,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9298","bwikiMission":"술집"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-34-talk-403813604-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-34","missionId":"event-rogue-34","mission":"술집","scene":"술집","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「이제 아하의 뜻을 받들어 함께 즐겨볼 시간입니다. 프란스 씨가 전용 보안 집단을 대동하고 링에 올라왔습니다」 바텐더가 말한다. 「이에 상대하는 참가자는 거한 아빌라입니다. 그의 용병 집단은 하나같이 거구들이라 절대 얕봐서는 안 됩니다!」","talkId":403813604,"textHash":"16655062093669266524","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:34/talk-403813604","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"e9c6d97ed6e59a81","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-34-talk-403813605-line"],"bwikiPage":"酒馆","bwikiRevision":58639,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9298","bwikiMission":"술집"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-34-talk-403813605-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-34","missionId":"event-rogue-34","mission":"술집","scene":"술집","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「또 참가하실 분 있으신가요? 제78201라운드의 참가자를 받습니다!」","talkId":403813605,"textHash":"9266896697761872461","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:34/talk-403813605","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"e9c6d97ed6e59a81","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"酒馆","bwikiRevision":58639,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9298","bwikiMission":"술집"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-34-text-12283846052509269714-choice","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-34","missionId":"event-rogue-34","mission":"술집","scene":"술집","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"다양한 방법으로 두 무리의 *손님*들을 해결한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"12283846052509269714","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:34/text-12283846052509269714","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"c4e2866b36d6b7c7","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"酒馆","bwikiRevision":58639,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9298","bwikiMission":"술집"}],"orderNote":"공식 사건 도감에 귀속된 한국어 원문입니다. BWIKI에서 확인한 모드별 구간만 연결하며 조건·확률·미확인 경계는 이어 붙이지 않습니다.","bwikiBaseOrder":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-34-talk-403813601-line","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-34-talk-403813602-line","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-34-talk-403813603-line","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-34-talk-403813604-line","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-34-talk-403813605-line","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-34-text-12283846052509269714-choice"],"bwiki":{"matchedRows":0,"cachedRows":6,"reviewRows":0,"segments":2,"reorderedRows":0},"retainedTextRowIds":[]}